.TH batten-show 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-show \- Report what something is, without changing it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten show\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report what something is, without changing it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-show\-agent(1)
What an agent may do in this repository: the read\-only verbs, the exit contract, and the declared gates
.TP
batten\-show\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
